    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Anthemis</b></i> is a genus of aromatic flowering plants in the family Asteraceae, closely related to <i>Chamaemelum</i>, and like that genus, known by the common name <b>chamomile</b>; some species are also called <b>dog-fennel</b> or <b>mayweed</b>. <i>Anthemis</i> are native to the Mediterranean region and southwest Asia east to Iran. A number of species have also become naturalized in the United Kingdom and other parts of the world.",
